ns:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Traveling:</strong> Shield your ears from the hum of airplane engines or chatter with our earplugs, designed to offer maximum comfort throughout your journey.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Yoga &amp; Meditation:</strong> Find your inner peace without disruptions by blocking out external noise, helping you to maintain focus in any setting.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Work &amp; Study:</strong> Increase productivity by minimizing background noise in shared spaces, whether at the office or the library.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sleeping:</strong> Ensure uninterrupted sleep by drowning out traffic, snoring, or other disturbances, offering peaceful rest at home or on the go.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Concerts &amp; Sports Events:</strong> Protect your hearing from loud music or cheers while enjoying a comfortable and secure fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Soft, medical-grade silicone for exceptional comfort</li>\r\n<li>Superior noise reduction for various environments</li>\r\n<li>Reusable, durable, and easy to maintain</li>\r\n<li>Universal fit for all ear sizes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Commission: 25% of each sale</li>\r\n<li>Cookie: 30 days</li>\r\n<li>Payment Method: PayPal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Affiliates receive a unique affiliate link to promote Orbis products</li>\r\n<li>No automatic discounts or auto-approve affiliates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"w-full md:pt-0 dark:border-white/20 md:border-transparent md:dark:border-transparent md:w-[calc(100%-.5rem)] juice:w-full\">\r\n<div class=\"px-3 text-base md:px-4 m-auto md:px-5 lg:px-1 xl:px-5\">\r\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex flex-1 gap-3 text-base juice:gap-4 juice:md:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-[40rem] xl:max-w-[48rem]\"><for